From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Treggat <taggert2222@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 20:39:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 17/27] sycl/llama : cheaper MTP draft tokens (q8_0 XMX FA, no
 logit pad, fast balloc)

- GGML_SYCL_XMX_FA_Q8: XMX flash attention reading q8_0 K/V (1-8+
  queries, D=256), used for the MTP draft context via -ctkd/-ctvd q8_0
- GGML_SYCL_XMX_FA_DRAFT_N1: f16 XMX attention at 1 query for the draft
  context only
- LLAMA_MTP_DRAFT_NOPAD: keep draft logits at draft-head width
- LLAMA_BALLOC_FAST: skip the per-decode coupled-sequence scan
- scripts/b70/gguf_draft_head_trim.py: trimmed draft-head variants
All default off; target outputs unchanged by the draft-only switches.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
